 # mygame-flk: made by flkforge from flkforge.toml. Change the recipe and run   
 # `flkforge render`, or edit this file and stop using flkforge for it.         
 #                                                                              
 # The server is Steam app 1, downloaded by steamcmd in its own stage           
 # and pinned by STEAM_BUILDID ([build] args in flk.toml). Steam serves only    
 # its current build, so the build fails once Steam has moved past the pin;     
 # old builds come back only from kept release images (flk releases rollback).  
─ hint ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 App name: lowercase letters, digits and dashes (flk's rule). Start experiments 
 with flkt- so they're easy to tell from real apps.                             
 The machines' names are flk's to make up. The directory: /tmp/mygame.flk       
 started from core/steam-game                                                   
